{"ts":"2026-07-27T22:12:12.697Z","author":"codex-root","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"b765f2eba6c8ee947e859c2f","agent_provenance":{"model":null},"op":"update_ownership_bypass","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-27T22:12:12.675Z","author":"codex-root","text":"First exact-head review found three actionable improvements: reject selectors when the live action schema has no target contract, redact private entity selectors from live-test failure diagnostics, and isolate cross-transport action execution behind a typed API client. Base release commit was merged before applying the fixes; generated changelog wording was corrected at its canonical PM source."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-27T22:12:12.697Z"}],"before_hash":"edb8822a1ad3cb82a953c2cbde4cee7983a2ef58d08d0f3f92f42a748b8e4d08","after_hash":"7574a0eb2aae96b9b12d387bd2ff53891f8bc2800d032d102e73b5ba59fdc4ba","message":"Record first review-loop decisions"}
{"ts":"2026-07-27T22:15:17.234Z","author":"codex-root","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"b765f2eba6c8ee947e859c2f","agent_provenance":{"model":null},"op":"update_ownership_bypass","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/2","value":{"created_at":"2026-07-27T22:15:17.211Z","author":"codex-root","text":"Verified CodeRabbit managed-package observations against the published PM 2026.7.27 SDK. The local listAllItemMetadata mirror hides two supported optional parameters but does not currently fail at runtime; managed extension type mirrors are upstream-owned and were reported after duplicate searches as unbraind/pm-cli#781. The similarity-label observation was rejected because the authoritative SDK explicitly reports exact_title, issue_code, and title_token_jaccard; package-managed sources were not hand-edited."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-27T22:15:17.234Z"}],"before_hash":"7574a0eb2aae96b9b12d387bd2ff53891f8bc2800d032d102e73b5ba59fdc4ba","after_hash":"8eab58a8e0a98c2426869fbc9ff23bfe248024bc6265349d3c3524767edf8cdb","message":"Record upstream review disposition"}
